WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:03.512
This is VERITY. Tamper-proof polls on Ethereum

2
00:00:03.592 --> 00:00:06.654
— where every vote is a public record that

3
00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:09.797
nobody can change. Not even the person who

4
00:00:09.877 --> 00:00:10.470
built it.

5
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.085
There are no accounts, and no passwords.

6
00:00:14.165 --> 00:00:16.365
Your wallet is your identity.

7
00:00:16.445 --> 00:00:19.746
I'll connect Phantom... and that's the only

8
00:00:19.826 --> 00:00:21.790
sign-in VERITY ever needs.

9
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.971
Live Polls shows everything that's open right

10
00:00:26.051 --> 00:00:28.076
now. Let's vote on this one.

11
00:00:28.156 --> 00:00:31.156
VERITY shows the exact network fee before

12
00:00:31.236 --> 00:00:34.538
anything is signed — a fraction of a cent, in

13
00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:35.590
free test ETH.

14
00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.815
My wallet signs it... and in a few seconds,

15
00:00:39.895 --> 00:00:42.140
it's written to the blockchain.

16
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.747
Only now do I see the results.

17
00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:48.823
They stay hidden until you've voted, so nobody

18
00:00:48.903 --> 00:00:51.766
just follows the crowd. And every vote comes

19
00:00:51.846 --> 00:00:54.241
with a receipt that links straight to

20
00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:54.910
Etherscan.

21
00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:58.260
Creating a poll takes about a minute.

22
00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.431
A question, a category, up to ten options, and

23
00:01:01.511 --> 00:01:04.533
an end time. The contract itself enforces the

24
00:01:04.613 --> 00:01:07.566
limits — so a bad poll is rejected before it

25
00:01:07.646 --> 00:01:08.600
costs anything.

26
00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:13.770
One signature... and it's live for everyone.

27
00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.031
Every poll has its own link and QR code.

28
00:01:18.111 --> 00:01:20.891
Press Recount, and your own browser re-adds

29
00:01:20.971 --> 00:01:23.751
every vote from the blockchain, then checks

30
00:01:23.831 --> 00:01:25.813
the total against the contract.

31
00:01:25.893 --> 00:01:28.540
You never have to trust VERITY's numbers.

32
00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.412
My Activity keeps a timeline of everything

33
00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.805
you've done, with the fee for each.

34
00:01:34.885 --> 00:01:37.950
Docs explains the contract — which is verified

35
00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:40.890
on Etherscan. And About tells you who built

36
00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:41.710
it, and why.

37
00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:46.595
No owner. No admin. No edit button.

38
00:01:46.675 --> 00:01:50.921
Just votes you can check for yourself.

39
00:01:51.001 --> 00:01:55.020
VERITY: vote once... verify forever.
